{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"crazy-eights-card-game UI copy.faq.3.a","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"crazy-eights-card-game.copy.faq.3.a","keys":["crazy-eights-card-game.copy.faq.3.a"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Apabila seorang pemain mengosongkan tangannya, pemain lain menambah nilai kad yang tinggal kepada jumlah mereka. Eight menghitung ZXQPH0000QXZ, raja, permaisuri dan jack ZXQPH0001QXZ, ace ZXQPH0002QXZ, dan kad nombor nilai muka mereka. Permainan berakhir apabila jumlah melebihi ZXQPH0003QXZ; pemain dengan jumlah terendah menang.","record_id":"59459b85a83c39083e5c3638c4c55fc28257ace344c8bd5256a6c65262e9229f","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.0793259812500082,"source":"When a player empties their hand, other players add their remaining card values to their totals. Eights count 50, kings, queens and jacks 10, aces 1, and number cards their face value. The game ends when a total exceeds 100; the player with the lowest total wins.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"82b941a5d4b11a41f185f5cf88284b62da24034725d06bde5b3a3f6c4a805415","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Apabila seorang pemain mengosongkan tangannya, pemain lain menambah nilai kad yang tinggal kepada jumlah mereka. Eight menghitung 50, raja, permaisuri dan jack 10, ace 1, dan kad nombor nilai muka mereka. Permainan berakhir apabila jumlah melebihi 100; pemain dengan jumlah terendah menang.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
