{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"fraction-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.0","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"fraction-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.0","keys":["fraction-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.0"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Pecahan mempunyai penjumlah di atas penjumlah bukan-sifar. Penjumlah menamakan bahagian-bahagian bersaiz sama. Penjumlah mengira bahagian-bahagian itu. Mengurangkan kedua-dua nombor dengan pembagi persekutuan terbesar mereka menyimpan nilai tidak berubah. Penjumlah positif menjadikan tanda-tanda lebih mudah dibandingkan.","record_id":"59637a1f2174a2c99ce6143a46c24b7d63e0cefb0c6679c5d03197a710b5ca05","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":1.730947550625018,"source":"A fraction has a numerator above a nonzero denominator. The denominator names the equal-sized parts. The numerator counts those parts. Reducing both numbers by their greatest common divisor keeps the value unchanged. A positive denominator makes signs easier to compare.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"9614b44469c2e261bc3d4423d6138004e20ce7b690a3da0a434535255a2f467d","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Pecahan mempunyai penjumlah di atas penjumlah bukan-sifar. Penjumlah menamakan bahagian-bahagian bersaiz sama. Penjumlah mengira bahagian-bahagian itu. Mengurangkan kedua-dua nombor dengan pembagi persekutuan terbesar mereka menyimpan nilai tidak berubah. Penjumlah positif menjadikan tanda-tanda lebih mudah dibandingkan.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
